# ---------------------------------------------------------------- page 8
R('<p>Exhibit 7 puts Studio beside 10 platforms that a Studio buyer also deals with, on eight things a developer with no client relationship can reach<sup class="fnref"><a href="#s32">32</a>, <a href="#s33">33</a>, <a href="#s34">34</a></sup>. The total counts how many of the eight criteria a developer can meet before any client relationship exists, so it measures each vendor’s selling model. Investment platforms cluster low because they gate: documentation, a sandbox and a first call follow a relationship, at Aladdin as at Bloomberg, State Street, SimCorp, Clearwater and Arcesium. Data and cloud platforms, which sell to developers directly, cluster high. Only Studio, among the investment platforms, offers an <a href="https://github.com/blackrock/aladdinsdk">open-source SDK</a><sup class="fnref"><a href="#s24">24</a></sup>.</p>',
  '<p>Exhibit 7 puts Studio beside 10 platforms that a Studio buyer also deals with<sup class="fnref"><a href="#s32">32</a>, <a href="#s33">33</a>, <a href="#s34">34</a></sup>. It scores each on eight things a developer with no client relationship can reach, from 0 to 2, so the total sums eight scores and runs from 0 to 16. A high total means the vendor opens to developers before any sale; a low total means access follows a relationship. So the total measures each vendor’s selling model. Investment platforms cluster low because they gate. At Aladdin, as at Bloomberg, State Street, SimCorp, Clearwater and Arcesium, documentation, a sandbox and a first call come after a relationship exists. Data and cloud platforms sell to developers directly and cluster high. Among the investment platforms, only Studio offers an <a href="https://github.com/blackrock/aladdinsdk">open-source SDK</a><sup class="fnref"><a href="#s24">24</a></sup>.</p>')
R('<p>Five BlackRock speakers define Studio on the record in the 128 recordings pulled for this document, with the titles the recordings give<sup class="fnref"><a href="#s29">29</a>, <a href="#s30">30</a></sup>.</p>',
  '<p>I pulled 128 recordings for this document<sup class="fnref"><a href="#s29">29</a>, <a href="#s30">30</a></sup>. Five BlackRock speakers define Studio in them. Exhibit 8 lists each speaker with the title the recording gives.</p>')
